operand-read stage into the pipeline while preserving the core IO and single-channel RVFI contract.\"\n  - file: rtl/hazard_unit.sv\n    description: \"Adjust dependency, stall, and flush handling for the added read stage without allowing duplicate or skipped retirements.\"\n  - file: rtl/forward_unit.sv\n    description: \"Extend forwarding priority to cover the additional operand-read stage and preserve the youngest producer value.\"\n  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: \"Consume the registered operands and metadata from the new stage while retaining divider handshake and branch behavior.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
