d control transfers.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/hazard_unit.sv\", \"description\": \"Interlock and squash younger work during resolution and consume the registered redirect without losing it to bus stalls.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Apply registered redirect targets with priority over fetch stalls while holding the PC during \n…[66800 of 69872 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:7bdc23c905c2d490]…\n \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 135.87, \"delta_pct\": -6.87, \"vs_baseline\": 1021.04, \"fmax_mhz\": 68.674, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 5054402, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 3162, \"ff\": 950, \"seeds\": [73.944, 68.674, 68.674], \"perturbations\": [[0, 73.944, 16], [1, 68.674, 16], [2, 68.674, 16]], \"lutram\": 8, \"bsram\": 6, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_operand/reg_q.imm_4_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_rf/regs_ER_s195\", \"slack_ns\": -8.524, \"arrival_ns\": 18.818, \"logic_cells\": 39, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_id\", \"cpu/u_rf\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 16, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-29T22:51:39.130103Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 9, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-09-30 hyp-20260930-003-r9s2 (regression, -6.87%): A four-entry return stack still regressed CoreMark because ABI-return decode, dynamic stack-top selection, and the predicted-target mux add work to the fetch-to-PC path, and saved return-recovery cycles did not repay that cost.\"}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
